  "published": "2026-11-02T13:37:41.397Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.14: animations are written. SaveAsJxl/ToJxl write every frame of an image with several frames, and Image.CreateFrameWriter writes frame by frame (forward only, one encoded frame and the previous canvas held). Durations in milliseconds, LoopCount as plays, each frame cropped to what changed; identical frames extend the previous one. Lossless round trips are exact, also through djxl; still images are written byte for byte as in 0.8.13. Requires PictureSharp 0.9.1. See docs/releases/release-0.8.14.md and docs/design/0.8.14-animation-encode.md.",
